{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"如何评估一个 Agent 系统的好坏？与传统 LLM 评估有什么不同？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 系统的评估与传统 LLM 评估有什么不同？请描述 Agent 专属的评估维度、指标体系和评估方法。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Agent 评估 vs LLM 评估的核心差异：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 LLM 评估</th>\n<th>Agent 系统评估</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>评估对象</td>\n<td>静态文本输出</td>\n<td>动态执行过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估标准</td>\n<td>困惑度、BLEU、ROUGE</td>\n<td>任务完成率、步骤效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试方式</td>\n<td>固定测试集</td>\n<td>动态环境交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关注点</td>\n<td>输出质量</td>\n<td>过程质量 + 结果质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本考量</td>\n<td>较少关注</td>\n<td>Token 消耗是关键指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Agent 专属评估维度：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AgentEvaluationFramework</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent 评估框架\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 结果指标</span>\n    RESULT_METRICS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"task_completion_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"任务完成率\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"answer_accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"答案准确率\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"user_satisfaction\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"用户满意度\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"success_at_k\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"k步内成功率\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 过程指标</span>\n    PROCESS_METRICS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"steps_to_complete\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"完成任务所需步数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call_accuracy\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用准确率\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"replan_count\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"重新规划次数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"retry_count\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"重试次数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"hallucination_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"幻觉率\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 成本指标</span>\n    COST_METRICS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"tokens_per_task\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每任务 Token 消耗\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"api_calls_per_task\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每任务 API 调用次数\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"latency_p50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"P50 延迟\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"latency_p99\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"P99 延迟\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"cost_per_task\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每任务成本\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 鲁棒性指标</span>\n    ROBUSTNESS_METRICS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"error_recovery_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"错误恢复率\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"edge_case_handling\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"边界 case 处理\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"adversarial_robustness\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"对抗鲁棒性\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"timeout_handling\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"超时处理\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>评估方法：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AgentEvaluator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent 评估器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>test_cases <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> TestCaseLoader<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>load<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>judge_llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GPT4<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># LLM-as-a-Judge</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">evaluate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> EvaluationReport<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"完整评估流程\"\"\"</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> test_case <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run_test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>aggregate_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run_test_case</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                           test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> TestCase<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> TestResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行单个测试用例\"\"\"</span>\n        start_time <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行 Agent</span>\n        trajectory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run_with_trace<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">input</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        elapsed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> start_time\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 评估结果</span>\n        completion <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>check_completion<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>expected<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        accuracy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>judge_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            predicted<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            expected<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>expected\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> TestResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            test_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>test_case<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            completed<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>completion<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            accuracy<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>accuracy<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            steps<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>total_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            latency<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>elapsed<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            tool_calls<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            errors<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>errors<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check_completion</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                        expected<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ExpectedOutput<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查任务是否完成\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 精确匹配</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> expected<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>exact<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 语义匹配（LLM-as-a-Judge）</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>judge_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>semantic_match<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> expected<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>semantic\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LLM-as-a-Judge 评估：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LLMAsJudge</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"使用 LLM 作为评估者\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    JUDGE_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    你是一个公正的评估者。请评估以下 Agent 的回答质量。\n    \n    任务：{task}\n    标准答案：{reference}\n    Agent 回答：{prediction}\n    \n    请从以下维度评分（1-5分）：\n    1. 准确性（信息是否正确）\n    2. 完整性（是否覆盖所有要点）\n    3. 相关性（是否回答了问题）\n    4. 有用性（对用户是否有帮助）\n    \n    输出格式：\n    {{\n        \"accuracy\": 分数,\n        \"completeness\": 分数,\n        \"relevance\": 分数,\n        \"helpfulness\": 分数,\n        \"overall\": 综合分数,\n        \"reasoning\": \"评分理由\"\n    }}\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">evaluate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prediction<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                 reference<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>JUDGE_PROMPT<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">format</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            task<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prediction<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>prediction<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reference<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reference <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"N/A\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>生产环境监控指标：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">PRODUCTION_METRICS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 技术指标</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"latency\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"p50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;2s\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"p99\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;10s\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"availability\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&gt;99.9%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"error_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;1%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 任务指标</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"task_success_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&gt;95%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"avg_steps_per_task\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;10\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"human_intervention_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;5%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 行为指标</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"hallucination_frequency\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;2%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_misuse_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;1%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"loop_detection_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;0.1%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 用户指标</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"csat_score\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&gt;4.5/5\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"nps_score\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&gt;50\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"retention_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&gt;80%\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：LLM-as-a-Judge 有什么局限性？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：①位置偏见（偏好某个位置的回答）②长度偏见（偏好更长的回答）③对特定风格有偏见。缓解：多 Judge 投票、设计去偏见 Prompt</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如何处理评估中的\"部分正确\"情况？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：使用细粒度评估，将任务拆解为子目标，分别评估每个子目标的完成情况，而非整体二分类</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：只看最终结果，不看过程</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：Agent 的过程指标（步数、重试次数、幻觉率）同样重要，反映了系统的健壮性和效率</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}